<title>LITHUANIA: DIRBTINIS SHARES PLUMMET, SIAULIU UP AGAIN.</title>
<headline>DIRBTINIS SHARES PLUMMET, SIAULIU UP AGAIN.</headline>
<text>
<p>* Yarn maker Dirbtinis Plaushtas plummeted on Thursday, falling to 0.01 litas from 1.81 litas but dealers said it was nothing serious.</p>
<p>* Siauliu Bank continued its bull-run, rising almost ten percent to 102.40 litas.</p>
<p>(A complete report follows)</p>
</text>
